        <item>
            <title>1.5.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:14:58 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/Titi257/lina/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ringtone: import one of your own audio files as the ringtone (Settings, Sound), and two new built-in sounds, Harp and Vintage telephone. As before, each can be previewed and has its own volume, separate from the call volume.</li>
<li>Compact window: the minimum height goes down to 560 points, and the dial pad no longer leaves empty space above the number and below the call button.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
